IAdPbL\",\"uid\":\"derek-zanetti--jill-good-art-opening\",\"url\":null,\"type\":\"event\",\"href\":\"https://whatsnext-lancaster.cdn.prismic.io/api/v2/documents/search?ref=ab6CthEAACAAdol-&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ab1qvxEAACIAdPbL%22%29+%5D%5D\",\"tags\":[],\"first_publication_date\":\"2026-03-20T15:44:23+0000\",\"last_publication_date\":\"2026-03-20T15:57:32+0000\",\"slugs\":[\"derek-zanetti--jill-good-art-opening\"],\"linked_documents\":[],\"lang\":\"en-us\",\"alternate_languages\":[],\"data\":{\"title\":\"Derek Zanetti & Jill Good Art Opening\",\"summary\":\"Join West Art in Welcoming an Art Exhibit by Derek Zanetti and Jill Good! Their work will be featured throughout West Art, so come hang and check it out!\\nDerek Zanetti is an artist, musician, author, and amateur gardener from Lancaster, Pennsylvania. Since 2009, he has spent all of his time traveling around the world putting on shows and connecting with people over the magic of artistic expression. After spending 16 years on a constant touring cycle, Derek decided to intentionally spend more time at home and more time in the studio creating larger bodies of visual work. On March 21, 2026, Derek will be unveiling his next show of work called HUMAN MEAT SOUP, a collection of drawings, paintings, music, and film woven together to tell the tale. We are living through a very odd time in history, where truth is ambiguous, adversity is plentiful, and accountability is nowhere to be found. HUMAN MEAT SOUP begins the conversation of: Who am I? And what role can I play in the rebuilding of something new?\\n\\nJILL GOOD is a quilter + textile artist based in Lancaster, PA.\",\"start_datetime\":\"2026-03-21T22:00:00+0000\",\"end_datetime\":\"2026-03-22T01:00:00+0000\",\"all_day\":false,\"event_type\":\"Opening\",\"status\":\"Scheduled\",\"featured\":false,\"cost\":\"Free\",\"age_restriction\":null,\"website_url\":{\"link_type\":\"Web\"},\"tickets_url\":{\"link_type\":\"Web\"},\"image\":{\"dimensions\":{\